 n- Bront Palarae\n- Dimas Danang\n- Dewa Dayana\n- Endy Arfian\n- Faiz Vis
 hal\n- Haydar Salishz\n- Ical Tanjung\n- Kiki Narendra\n\n\nDans une priso
