 than Coen\, Joel Coen\n𝗣𝗵𝗼𝘁𝗼𝗴𝗿𝗮𝗽𝗵𝗶𝗲 : 
 Barry Sonnenfeld\n𝗣𝗿𝗼𝗱𝘂𝗰𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻 : Circle Films\
 n\n𝗔𝗰𝘁𝗲𝘂𝗿𝘀 :\n- Nicolas Cage\n- Holly Hunter\n- Trey 
