DESCRIPTION:Lords of War\n(4.9)\n\nCrime\, Thriller\, Drame\n\nFrance\, Uni
 ted States of America\, Morocco\n(English)\n\n𝗥𝗲𝗮𝗹𝗶𝘀𝗮
